msgid "A reminder changed on both sides at once; next run decides."
msgstr "Sebuah pengingat berubah di kedua sisi sekaligus; proses berikutnya yang menentukan."

#: src/postulo_dav/sync.py
msgid "A reminder deleted here had been changed on the phone since the last sync. The task was left in the task list."
msgstr "Sebuah pengingat yang dihapus di sini telah diubah di ponsel sejak sinkronisasi terakhir. Tugasnya dibiarkan di daftar tugas."

